text:
Can You Build an LLM from Scratch with $0? I Did.

This is a humorous explainer video about my journey building **GIANT** — my own implementation of a standard Large Language Model (LLM), using the JAX machine learning framework.

This is the first video in a series where I explore building a mini-framework of machine learning models — not limited to text. GIANT is a standard Transformer implementation that I’ll use as a base to experiment with various architectures.

#jax #ai #llm #transformer #chatgpt  #machinelearning #programmingmemes

